WEBVTT

00:11:59.871 --> 00:12:04.120
I razmišljam kako
ove skromne promene

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:07.063
u prostoru i politici

00:12:07.063 --> 00:12:09.088
mnogih gradova sveta,

00:12:09.088 --> 00:12:11.802
u prvenstveno hitnosti

00:12:11.802 --> 00:12:14.076
kolektivne mašte,

00:12:14.076 --> 00:12:15.550
dok ove zajednice

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.957
ponovo osmišljavaju
svoje oblike upravljanja,

00:12:17.957 --> 00:12:20.648
društvenog organizovanja
i infrastrukture,

00:12:20.648 --> 00:12:22.576
zaista jesu u centru

00:12:22.576 --> 00:12:24.664
novog oblikovanja

00:12:24.664 --> 00:12:27.976
demokratskih politika grada.

00:12:27.976 --> 00:12:31.253
Zapravo, to je ono
što bi moglo postati okvir